{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》昨日播出最新一集，陳自瑤飾演的關子盈捲入小三醜聞後身敗名裂，更慘遭落藥迷姦。她致電姚子羚飾演的經理人對質時情緒徹底崩潰，聲嘶力竭地連環尖叫。這場極具張力的高難度戲份背後隱藏着令人意想不到拍攝內幕。</p>\n<h2>《玫瑰戰爭》陳自瑤崩潰怒掟電話</h2>\n<p>昨晚播出的劇情高潮迭起，關子盈懷疑自己被迷姦後，隨即致電由姚子羚飾演兼暗戀老闆雲生經理人鳳儀大興問罪之師。面對鳳儀極度惡意地故作不知情，受盡連環打擊令子盈情緒陷入終極崩潰邊緣。她不僅在電話中聲嘶力竭地連番怒吼「點解要係我呀，點解係我呀！」，最後更因滿腔怒血無處宣洩而激動地將電話狠狠掟向遠處。整個畫面將角色絕望無助與極度憤怒交織出來，成為該集討論度最高一幕。</p>\n<h2>高難度情緒轉折獲劇組全場拍掌</h2>\n<p>這場戲份要求演員在一秒間由被落藥後低能量昏沉狀態，瞬間跳轉至極高能量崩潰爆發，難度極高。陳自瑤透露由於拍攝時間緊逼，埋位前一度信心不足，幸好導演一句「試當真」猶如強心針。她表示一Roll機嗌Action後，望向四周再望向自己便突然進入極崩潰狀態，最終憑藉超強爆發力一Take過完美完成拍攝。對於這次破格演出帶來極大驚喜，她謙虛地表示「可以幾秒之內進入到狀態，都要多謝劇本同劇組嘅幫忙。」</p>\n<h2>關子盈捲入小三醜聞致身敗名裂</h2>\n<p>劇中關子盈這個角色可謂命途多舛，堪稱全劇最慘女主角。她原本在職場上努力打拼，卻不幸捲入一宗轟動全城小三醜聞，導致多年來建立起來良好聲譽瞬間毀於一旦。正當她處於人生最低谷時，更惹來一直暗戀老闆雲生經理人鳳儀強烈妒忌，繼而遭到連環陷害甚至落藥迷姦。這些接二連三沉重打擊不僅將角色推向深淵，同時亦為演員提供一個極大發揮空間，讓陳自瑤能夠將角色內心深處那份破碎感演繹出來。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚陳自瑤演技更上一層樓</h2>\n<p>劇集播出後隨即在各大討論區掀起熱烈討論，大批觀眾對這場震撼人心崩潰戲份給予高度評價。不少網民被陳自瑤淚如泉湧逼真演繹深深打動，紛紛留言表示「陳自瑤角色令人心痛，演技更上一層樓」。亦有觀眾認為她將受害者那份無助與憤怒拿捏得恰到好處，完全擺脫過往既定形象，展現出令人眼前一亮專業實力。網上各大平台充斥着關於這場戲份截圖與熱烈討論。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455987473367742_17029437576af6cf834ae27.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"50a.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455987473367742_17029437576af6cf834ae27.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455987663580337_20276107476af6cf85124ef.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"53.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455987663580337_20276107476af6cf85124ef.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455987827519683_20651868666af6cf86a2d8c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"55.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455987827519683_20651868666af6cf86a2d8c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455988044697558_11240223626af6cf890ee4e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"61.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455988044697558_11240223626af6cf890ee4e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455988281197208_10802444546af6cf8b3eeb5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"65.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455988281197208_10802444546af6cf8b3eeb5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455988460420641_11453954836af6cf8cf3938.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"64.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455988460420641_11453954836af6cf8cf3938.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T08:58:44.775056+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1169,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T08:51:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T08:52:07.628434+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T08:52:07.628434+00:00","content_hash":"638aa952b228e0d2c3a9131dff999bb6c86a50e9fc763ba682ffc701836add8f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}